# Session handoff

If `HANDOFF.md` exists at the repo root, **read it before other work** on the first turn of a new chat (or when the user says continue / pick up / handoff).

Treat it as the current position: Goal, Done, In progress, Decisions, Constraints, Next.

Do not invent progress that is not in that file. If `HANDOFF.md` is missing, skip this — do not create one unless asked.
